            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Hazayeli aramubaza, at’ Urizwa n’iki ga mugenzi? Aramwishura, ati N’uko mbona ibibi uzogirira Abisirayeli; amaboma yabo uzoyatongoza umuriro, n’abasore babo uzobicisha inkota; utuyoya twabo uzotumenagura, abagore babo bafise inda uzobafomoza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.17.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 17:43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.9.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 9:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.19.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 19:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hazayeli aramwishura, ati Mbega nkanje umuntu w’imbga, n’inda n’indesho, nd’ uwo gukora ibikomeye ben’ ivyo? Elisa aramwishura, at’ Uhoraho yanyeretse k’uzoba umwami w’i Siriya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ avuye aho Elisa ari, asubira kwa shebuja; shebuja aramubaza, ati Elisa yakubgiye iki? Na we aramwishura, ati Yambgiye ng’ Uzokira nta kabuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye bgaho, Hazayeli yābīra uburengeti, abginika mu mazi, abumuta mu maso, aramupfunda arapfa. Hazayeli aca asubira ku ngoma yiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
