        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ugira gatanu Yoramu mwene Ahabu umwami w’Abisirayeli, ari ku ngoma, ni ho Yehoramu mwene Yehoshafati umwami w’Abayuda, yaja ku ngoma i Buyuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.21.5+2CH.21.6+2CH.21.7+2CH.21.8+2CH.21.9+2CH.21.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 21:5-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yatangura kwima, yar’ amaze imyaka mirongwitatu n’ibiri; araheza amara imyaka munani i Yerusalemu ari ku ngoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko yagendera mu ngeso z’abami b’ Abisirayeli, nk’ukw ab’ inzu ya Ahabu bākora, kuko yari yābiriye umukobga wa Ahabu; nukw akora ivyo Uhoraho abona kw ari bibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
