          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yehoramu aca ajabukana n’imikogote yiwe yose y’intambara, afata i Zayiri; maz’ Abanyedomu bamutaye hagati, ahenga mw ijoro, bo n’abagabisha b’imikogote yiwe, bīcīra inzira mur’ abo Banyedomu; ingabo ziwe zica zirahunga zīsubirira i wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.21"
            ]
          }
