        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Yehoramu ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambga hamwe na bo ku murwa wa Dawidi; maz’ umuhungu wiwe Ahaziya asubira ku ngoma yiwe.",
          "type": "text",
