          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahaziya aho yatangura kwima yar’ amaze imyaka mirongwibiri n’ibiri; araheza amara umwaka umwe i Yerusalemu ari ku ngoma. Nyina yitwa Ataliya, umwuzukuru wa Omuri umwami w’Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagendera mu ngeso z’ab’ inzu ya Ahabu, agakora ivyo Uhoraho abona kw ari bibi, nk’ukw ab’ inzu ya Ahabu nyene bāgenda bakora; kuko yar’ afitaniye akamwe na bo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.27"
            ]
          }
        }
