              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye atabara Yoramu mwene Ahabu, baja gutera Hazayeli umwami w’i Siriya i Ramoti‐gileyadi; maz’ Abasiriya bakomeretsa Yoramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
